  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Civilian Impact Monitoring Project (CIMP) aims to strengthen the protection of civilians in Yemen by providing real-time, countrywide monitoring and data-driven analysis of the civilian impact of armed violence, enabling evidence-based humanitarian response, advocacy, and early warning.</narrative>
